# MOVEMENT II — Section B b35-60, C minor.
# The Mvt-I ostinato returns literally (CELL in 16ths = its old speed)
# under the slow pulse: a memory breaking into the song. ob1 laments with
# the T1 head; fl1/ob1 sigh in thirds; rising sequence of the cantilena
# head (vn1) b43-48; ff climax Ab - N6 - Ger6 - V (b49-52); subito p,
# ostinato thins and slows back to pizz 8ths over the Bb7 pedal.

